      "message": "Empty is fine by me given that C++ is already doing it.\n\nIf it wasn\u0027t I\u0027d push for /android/ or similar, but given that -fdebug-prefix-map is already remapping relative rather than using a .gdbinit setting, that would be a separate change where we\u0027d propose swapping the other debug prefix as well. They should match.",
